#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0581 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: None of TRTP, TRTPGy, TRTA, and TRTAGy are present and none of the character treatment variables in ADSL defined in the IG are present
#note "Only trt01p is present, spelled in lower case as a SAS dataset may carry it. Column names match case-insensitively (the Check's var_exists does too), so the Requirements.Variables.None entry for TRTxxP matches it and the rule skips."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col trt01p type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | X
---
